        "official_en_sha256": "c50846fb9e725479889ed95892f33f4b6cd47d555e9dc722cf60e48f2feef668"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うむ。\r\nアルドールとヘス……。\r\nパラデイアの民が二つに分かれて争っておるときじゃ。",
        "official_en": "Aye. ’Twas an age when Paladia was gripped with war... The populace was divided into two opposing nations—Aldore and Hess.",
        "real_en": "Yes. When the people of Paladia were divided into Aldore and Hess and fighting each other."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
