      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここは精神世界じゃからのう。\r\n気の持ちようで\r\n見た目をチョコボにすることもできるのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "The very same. In this realm, the right mindset allows one to manifest themselves as anything—a chocobo, for instance.",
        "real_en": "This is a world of the mind. If you put your mind to it, you can even make yourself look like a chocobo."
