      "text": {
        "jp": "そうじゃ。\r\n元の世界に戻りたければ\r\nそこの魔道書に触れればよいからな。",
        "official_en": "Ah, one thing. Should you wish to return to reality, you need only touch that magic tome.",
        "real_en": "Oh, one more thing. If you want to go back to the world we came from, just touch that spellbook over there."
      },
      "review": {
