      "text": {
        "jp": "地道に探すしかないのう。\r\nまあ、この辺りのことはよく知っておるから、\r\n道案内ならワシに任せておけ。",
        "official_en": "There is no easy way to locate her, I’m afraid. Do not fret, though. I am well-acquainted with this locale, and I shall happily act as a guide.",
        "real_en": "We'll have to search for her patiently. I know this area well, though, so leave the guiding to me."
      },
